- `READY FOR QA: B855 NEXUSAI RD-894 PROBE CELLS b855/nexusai-894-probe-cells @ <sha40, read by ls-remote AFTER your push> / tier <per the Stamp> / 1 commit on main <main sha40> (<n> ahead, <m> behind) / diff exactly the rd891 test file and the counts file / test file 0 lines removed, backend and static numstat empty / cells G H I green at main, red under MU1 / MU2 and MU4 / MU6 as named, the 8 old cells green under all four / counts <5220+N> / 310 regenerated once, equal to verify / verify VERDICT PASS tests <n> suites <m> at the head / no product byte / no Deploy demo run on the branch / CodeQL UNMEASURED / 0 dismissals / 0 Jira writes / 0 gh writes / PRIOR WORK present`
- `PARTIAL: B855 NEXUSAI RD-894 PROBE CELLS <no branch pushed | branch pushed with ...> / done <steps> / not done <step: the measurement> / what the next measurement is / PRIOR WORK present`
